.TH "Docv::Tabs" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Tabs \- Tab stops in columns, relative to the block\(aqs indent.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Tabs\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Tab stops in columns, relative to the block\(aqs indent. Stops beyond the
explicit list repeat every \fB\%repeat\fR columns.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBDEFAULT = new\fR
Default stops: every 5 columns (groff\(aqs \fB\%0.5i\fR on a terminal).
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(stops : Array(Int32) = [] of Int32, repeat : Int32 = 5)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef next_stop(col : Int32) : Int32\fR
Returns the first stop after column \fIcol\fR.
.PP
\fBdef repeat : Int32\fR
.PP
\fBdef stops : Array(Int32)\fR
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/ast.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "Docv" (3cr),
.BR "docv" (7cr)
